From dc8f07fbd07ad9627a66c70d0b9c3466bf09d7ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Salo <salomannen1234@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 17:46:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 20/22] oplus-fwk: add material blur helpers and Image HDR
 compatibility shim

Framework-side surfaces the OEM camera/gallery stack expects:

- OplusBlurParam / OplusRenderEffect / OplusViewBackgroundRenderEffect
  material blur helpers, backing the framework RenderEffect hooks.
- OplusImageHdrImpl compatibility shim for the Image HDR path.

Squashed by topic from the m4 refinement series.

(cherry picked from commit ef58f2a6e8cd8154c8631f3d470a69a82f012e56)
